      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/5308",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5308",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5308.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5308.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-09-08T10:49:42Z"
      },
      "body": "1. Preserve Marek's original source-location kprobe implementation and authorship.\r\n2. Resolve source-line kprobes against the live kernel and currently loaded modules, including the parser fix for paths such as `kprobe@drivers/net/loopback.c:74`.\r\n3. Fix Alpine/musl static linking of the libdwfl kernel-module helpers by adding and propagating the optional `libfts` dependency.\r\n\r\ntest log：\r\nsudo  \\\r\ntimeout --signal=INT --kill-after=3 30 \\\r\n./bpftrace \\\r\n--unsafe \\\r\n-e 'kprobe@fs/open.c:1390 {\r\nprintf(\"UBUNTU_LINE_HIT pid=%d comm=%s\\n\", pid, comm);\r\nexit();\r\n}'\r\n\r\nAttached 1 probe\r\nUBUNTU_LINE_HIT pid=500 comm=systemd-journal\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/5308/reactions",
        "total_count": 0,
        "+1": 0,
        "-1": 0,
