      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/5330",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5330",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5330.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5330.patch",
        "merged_at": null
      },
      "body": "Follow-up to #5308, which is now merged.\r\n\r\n### Fix\r\nSource-location kprobes previously resolved FILE:LINE to an address without\r\nspecifying the owning kernel module.\r\n\r\nThis change records the owning module returned by the DWARF lookup in\r\n AttachPoint::target, so the module BTF lookup uses the module containing the\r\nsource location.\r\n\r\nThis confirms that only the owning module BTF is selected. Type resolution for\r\nkernel kprobes is handled separately in #5346.\r\n\r\nCloses #5329\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/5330/reactions",
