        "blocking": 0,
        "total_blocking": 0
      },
      "body": "```\n$ sudo bpftrace -e 'kprobe:vfs_write {  printf(\"entry func = %s\\n\", func); } kretprobe:vfs_write { printf(\"exit func = %s\\n\", func); exit(); }'\nAttached 1 probe\nentry func = vfs_write\nexit func = __x64_sys_pwrite64\n```\n\nWe need to adjust the `func` in codegen if we detect we're in a session return branch.\n",
