      "number": 5166,
      "title": "CMake: Fix circular static library dependencies",
      "user": {
        "login": "viktormalik",
        "id": 7603704,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDM3MDQ=",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7603704?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/viktormalik",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-05-18T06:07:10Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-05-19T05:49:26Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-05-19T05:49:23Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/5166",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5166",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5166.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5166.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-05-19T05:49:23Z"
      },
      "body": "Stacked PRs:\r\n * #5167\r\n * __->__#5166\r\n\r\n\r\n--- --- ---\r\n\r\n### CMake: Fix circular static library dependencies\r\n\r\n\r\nSome internal static libraries may have subtle circular dependencies.\r\nIn particular:\r\n- attachpoint_passes.cpp uses Dwarf from dwarf_parser.cpp\r\n- attachpoint_passes.cpp is in the `ast` target which is normally linked\r\n  *after* the `runtime` target\r\n\r\nThis may lead to the following linker error:\r\n\r\n    /usr/bin/ld.bfd: ast/libast.a(attachpoint_passes.cpp.o): [...]\r\n    [...] undefined reference to `bpftrace::DwarfParseError::ID'\r\n\r\nFix the issue by wrapping the linked libraries with `--start-group` and\r\n`--end-group`, which allows the linker to resolve the dependencies\r\nproperly.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Viktor Malik <viktor.malik@gmail.com>",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/5166/reactions",
