      },
      "body": "<!--\r\nNote: bpftrace is under active development and not all distros ship the most\r\nrecent version yet. Please make sure the bug reproduces on the latest release\r\nor master.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### What reproduces the bug? Provide code if possible.\r\n```\r\n./bpftrace -e 'tracepoint:sched:sched_switch { $task = (struct task_struct *)curtask; if ($task->state & 0x02) { @[kstack] = count(); }  }' --include linux/sched.h\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:67:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:68:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:69:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:70:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:71:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:72:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:73:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/uapi/linux/sched.h:74:2: error: unknown type name '__aligned_u64'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/alternative.h:85:8: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/linux/kasan-checks.h:16:15: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/linux/kasan-checks.h:20:15: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/linux/kasan-checks.h:34:15: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/include/linux/kasan-checks.h:38:15: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:97:24: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:100:2: error: use of undeclared identifier 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:103:16: error: use of undeclared identifier 'negative'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:105:9: error: use of undeclared identifier 'negative'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:135:24: error: unknown type name 'bool'\r\n/lib/modules/5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64/build/arch/x86/include/asm/bitops.h:138:9: error: use of undeclared identifier 'bool'\r\nfatal error: too many errors emitted, stopping now [-ferror-limit=]\r\nERROR: Include headers with missing type definitions or install BTF information to your system.\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nlsb_release -a\r\nNo LSB modules are available.\r\nDistributor ID:\tDebian\r\nDescription:\tDebian GNU/Linux 10 (buster)\r\nRelease:\t10\r\nCodename:\tbuster\r\n```\r\n```\r\nuname -a\r\nLinux n37-041-169 5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64 #5.4.250.bsk.5 SMP Debian 5.4.250.bsk.5 Tue Mar 19 03:16:17 UTC  x86_64 GNU/Linux\r\n```\r\n```\r\ndpkg -l | grep dbg\r\nii  linux-image-5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64-dbg         5.4.250.bsk.5                                                    amd64        Linux kernel debugging symbols for 5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### `bpftrace --info` output\r\n```\r\n./bpftrace --info\r\nSystem\r\n  OS: Linux 5.4.250.bsk.5-amd64 #5.4.250.bsk.5 SMP Debian 5.4.250.bsk.5 Tue Mar 19 03:16:17 UTC\r\n  Arch: x86_64\r\n\r\nBuild\r\n  version: v0.21.2\r\n  LLVM: 18.1.7\r\n  unsafe probe: no\r\n  bfd: yes\r\n  liblldb (DWARF support): yes\r\n  libsystemd (systemd notify support): no\r\n\r\nKernel helpers\r\n  probe_read: yes\r\n  probe_read_str: yes\r\n  probe_read_user: no\r\n  probe_read_user_str: no\r\n  probe_read_kernel: no\r\n  probe_read_kernel_str: no\r\n  get_current_cgroup_id: yes\r\n  send_signal: yes\r\n  override_return: yes\r\n  get_boot_ns: no\r\n  dpath: no\r\n  skboutput: no\r\n  get_tai_ns: no\r\n  get_func_ip: no\r\n  jiffies64: no\r\n  for_each_map_elem: no\r\n\r\nKernel features\r\n  Instruction limit: 1000000\r\n  Loop support: yes\r\n  btf: yes\r\n  module btf: no\r\n  map batch: no\r\n  uprobe refcount (depends on Build:bcc bpf_attach_uprobe refcount): yes\r\n\r\nMap types\r\n  hash: yes\r\n  percpu hash: yes\r\n  array: yes\r\n  percpu array: yes\r\n  stack_trace: yes\r\n  perf_event_array: yes\r\n  ringbuf: no\r\n\r\nProbe types\r\n  kprobe: yes\r\n  tracepoint: yes\r\n  perf_event: yes\r\n  kfunc: no\r\n  kprobe_multi: no\r\n  uprobe_multi: no\r\n  raw_tp_special: no\r\n  iter: no\r\n```",
