        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5272.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-07-27T12:53:51Z"
      },
      "body": "Hi all,\r\n\r\nAdded several fixes for s390  in bpftrace, which eliminate many of the existing test case failures. There are still a few remaining issues that I am actively working on.\r\nOur current focus is to make runtime-tests.sh and bpftrace_test pass cleanly on big-endian architectures. Additionally, following Jordan Rome's earlier suggestion regarding GitHub CI integration - s390, I discussed the proposal with the team and we plan to contribute the integration in the near future. Thank you.\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [x] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [x] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
