      "id": 4077117073,
      "node_id": "PR_kwDOCMCh9c7KqgJu",
      "number": 5075,
      "title": "Fix ASTSource line collection bug",
      "user": {
        "login": "jordalgo",
        "id": 1537292,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzcyOTI=",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1537292?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/jordalgo",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/jordalgo/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-03-15T00:00:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-03-15T10:59:37Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-03-15T10:59:36Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/5075",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5075",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5075.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/5075.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-03-15T10:59:36Z"
      },
      "body": "When collecting lines for an ASTSource object we use std::getline which skips the final empty line in a bpftrace script. This is problematic because for a script ending in a trailing new line the lexer advances line counter and the END token gets assigned this new line.\r\n\r\nThis becomes a real problem only in the case when we try to access this last line which happens when we set a warning (`addWarning`) or an error on the entire program node, which we do in the CreateClangBuildPass when there are clang warnings.\r\n\r\nThe access happens in location.cpp:\r\n```\r\nfor (int i = begin.line; i <= end.line; i++) {\r\n  assert(i <= static_cast<int>(source_->lines_.size()));\r\n  result.push_back(source_->lines_[i - 1]);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAs you can see there is an assert but these get stripped out in release builds.\r\n\r\nThe fix is to check if there is a trailing new line context.cpp when constructing the ASTSource object and emplace an empty new line into `lines_`.\r\n\r\nFixes: https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/5073\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
