      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2025-12-17T21:30:06Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-12-17T22:47:48Z",
      "closed_at": "2025-12-17T22:47:48Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4909",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4909",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4909.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4909.patch",
        "merged_at": "2025-12-17T22:47:48Z"
      },
      "body": "This is because size_t is 32bits which is the type returned by type().GetSize() but an Integer's value is 64bits.\r\n\r\n\r\n(cherry picked from commit a19d6abaa20ca307d9307ef0d2d58712f26c8e2f)\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
