      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4908",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4908",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4908.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4908.patch",
        "merged_at": "2025-12-17T13:17:19Z"
      },
      "body": "This is because size_t is 32bits which is the type returned by type().GetSize() but an Integer's value is 64bits.\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
