        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 3,
      "created_at": "2026-02-03T04:58:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-02-04T01:33:22Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-02-04T01:33:21Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4984",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4984",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4984.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4984.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-02-04T01:33:21Z"
      },
      "body": "Stacked PRs:\n * __->__#4984\n\n\n--- --- ---\n\n### builtins: make `cpid` similar to `ncpu` and AOT-friendly\n\n\nInstead of being filled in at runtime, make this a static constant that\ncan be inlined by the verifier. This will work at runtime and all other\ntimes, for programs that work even when there isn't a child. The cpid\nwill simply be zero in those cases.\n\nSigned-off-by: Adin Scannell <amscanne@meta.com>\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4984/reactions",
        "total_count": 0,
        "+1": 0,
        "-1": 0,
        "laugh": 0,
        "hooray": 0,
        "confused": 0,
        "heart": 0,
        "rocket": 0,
        "eyes": 0
      },
      "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4984/timeline",
      "performed_via_github_app": null,
      "state_reason": null,
      "score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4961",
      "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace",
      "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4961/labels{/name}",
      "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4961/comments",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4961/events",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4961",
      "id": 3841692732,
      "node_id": "PR_kwDOCMCh9c6-offo",
      "number": 4961,
      "title": "Remove emit_codegen_types flag from DIBuilderBPF",
      "user": {
        "login": "huowj",
        "id": 30740958,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzQwOTU4",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30740958?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/huowj",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/huowj/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2026-01-22T07:47:38Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-01-26T15:57:40Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-01-26T15:57:40Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4961",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4961",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4961.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4961.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-01-26T15:57:40Z"
      },
      "body": "The original static_assert(false, \"unknown field type\") would always trigger during template parsing, even for valid types. This prevents valid code from compiling.\r\n\r\nChange to static_assert(sizeof(T) == 0, \"unknown field type\") which is a template-dependent expression that only triggers when:\r\n1. The template is actually instantiated\r\n2. Control flow reaches the else branch for unsupported types\r\n\r\nThis allows compilation to proceed for valid types (std::string and integral types) while still providing a compile-time error for unsupported types.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease provide a description of your change below this comment.\r\n\r\nThen please complete the checklist.\r\n\r\nUseful contribution guidelines and tips are in docs/developers.md.\r\n\r\nWarning: please make sure that you have implemented and tested your\r\n         change against the latest version of bpftrace (unless opening a\r\n         PR for a release branch).\r\n-->\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [x] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [x] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4961/reactions",
        "total_count": 0,
        "+1": 0,
        "-1": 0,
