      },
      "body": "Stacked PRs:\n * __->__#5064\n * #5065\n\n\n--- --- ---\n\n### [LLVM 22] Add support for LLVM 22\n\n\nAs per the release instructions.\n\nhttps://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/5000\n\nThis involved a nix.flake update to use the upstream appimage as danobi's\nfork was not compatible.\n\nAlso drop support for LLVM 17.\nSigned-off-by: Jordan Rome <linux@jordanrome.com>",
