      "issue_dependencies_summary": {
        "blocked_by": 0,
        "total_blocked_by": 0,
        "blocking": 0,
        "total_blocking": 0
      },
      "body": "Using `emit_codegen_types` when calling GetType in codegen will produce different LLVM types depending on the SizedType (e.g. uint64 instead of ptr). We shouldn't need to do this anymore so this flag and this translation part should go away.\n\nContext:\n- https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4439",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4443/reactions",
