      "body": "<!--\nNote: bpftrace is under active development and not all distros ship the most\nrecent version yet. Please make sure the bug reproduces on the latest release\nor master.\n-->\n\n### What reproduces the bug? Provide code if possible.\n\nDoc:  https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/INSTALL.md#generic-build-process\n\n1. clone project first \n``` shell\ngit clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace\n```\n2. make compile dir\n``` shell\ncd bpftrace/build\n```\n3. run cmake command\n``` shell\ncmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release ../\n```\n4. run make command, then fatal occurs\n``` shell\n❯ make\n[  0%] [BISON][bison_parser] Building parser with bison 3.8.2\n[  1%] [FLEX][flex_lexer] Building scanner with flex 2.6.4\n[  1%] Building CXX object CMakeFiles/parser.dir/parser.tab.cc.o\n[  1%] Building CXX object CMakeFiles/parser.dir/lex.yy.cc.o\n[  1%] Linking CXX static library libparser.a\n[  1%] Built target parser\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/required_resources.dir/required_resources.cpp.o\n[  2%] Linking CXX static library librequired_resources.a\n[  2%] Built target required_resources\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/compiler_core.dir/functions.cpp.o\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/compiler_core.dir/struct.cpp.o\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/CMakeFiles/compiler_core.dir/types.cpp.o\n[  2%] Linking CXX static library libcompiler_core.a\n[  2%] Built target compiler_core\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/debugfs/CMakeFiles/debugfs.dir/debugfs.cpp.o\n[  2%] Linking CXX static library libdebugfs.a\n[  2%] Built target debugfs\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/util.dir/bpf_funcs.cpp.o\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/util.dir/bpf_names.cpp.o\n[  2%] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/util.dir/bpf_progs.cpp.o\n[  3%] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/util.dir/cgroup.cpp.o\n[  3%] Building CXX object src/util/CMakeFiles/util.dir/cpus.cpp.o\n[  3%] Buildi