      "number": 4987,
      "title": "Fix interval probe attachment when CPU 0 is offline (#4966)",
      "user": {
        "login": "nanshuaibo",
        "id": 117452805,
        "node_id": "U_kgDOBwAwBQ",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117452805?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/nanshuaibo",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/nanshuaibo/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 7,
      "created_at": "2026-02-04T12:08:47Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-02-13T02:59:06Z",
      "closed_at": "2026-02-13T02:50:36Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4987",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4987",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4987.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4987.patch",
        "merged_at": "2026-02-13T02:50:36Z"
      },
      "body": "This PR addresses the issue where attaching `interval` probes fails when CPU 0 is offline (or hot-unplugged).\r\n\r\nPreviously, `AttachedIntervalProbe::make` hardcoded `cpu=0` when creating the perf event. This caused [open_perf_event](cci:1://file:///data/8797/nhlos/lagvm/LINUX/android/external/bpftrace/src/attached_probe.cpp:856:0-884:1) to fail if CPU 0 was not available.\r\n\r\nThis change updates it to utilize `util::get_online_cpus()` to dynamically select the first available online CPU, ensuring the probe can be attached successfully regardless of CPU 0's status. All other online CPUs are then looped over correctly as before.\r\n\r\nFixes #4966.\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc` (N/A)\r\n- [x] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [x] The new behaviour is covered by tests",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4987/reactions",
