      "id": 3543904016,
      "node_id": "PR_kwDOCMCh9c6vOXgn",
      "number": 4762,
      "title": "Refactor argument parsing to use `Result`",
      "user": {
        "login": "viktormalik",
        "id": 7603704,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDM3MDQ=",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7603704?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/viktormalik",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 0,
      "created_at": "2025-10-23T09:35:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-10-23T13:17:34Z",
      "closed_at": "2025-10-23T11:30:33Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4762",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4762",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4762.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4762.patch",
        "merged_at": "2025-10-23T11:30:33Z"
      },
      "body": " Most functions for resolving arguments from BTF return `std::shared_ptr<Struct>`. In case the resolution fails, they return\r\n`nullptr` and pass the error message via an argument. Use the `Result` class instead since this is its exact purpose. Refactor `ArgsResolverPass` to consume the `Result`.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, move `TracepointFormatParser` into `src/ast/passes` since it is indeed a pass. Truth is that it also provides a class with static functions but those are exclusively used from with other passes, so it is the most logical place.This also fixes a non-determinism in builds since `tracepoint_format_parser.cpp` was originally built into the `libbpftrace` target, however, the `ast` target (which uses functions from `TracepointFormatParser`) does not depend on the `libbpftrace` target so the order of library linking affected potential linker errors.\r\n\r\nThis is a pre-requisite for introducing tracepoint args parsing from BTF.\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4762/reactions",
        "total_count": 0,
        "+1": 0,
