      "body": "Stacked PRs:\n * #4931\n * __->__#4906\n\n\n--- --- ---\n\n### Use cmake generator expressions\n\n\nProblems with the older config-time approach:\n- Global pollution: Affects ALL targets in the project\n- Multi-config generators: Breaks with Visual Studio,\nXcode which support multiple configs\n\nSigned-off-by: Jordan Rome <linux@jordanrome.com>\nSigned-off-by: Jordan Rome <linux@jordanrome.com>",
