      "title": "stdlib: uaddr: support PIE and dynamic library symbols",
      "user": {
        "login": "Rtoax",
        "id": 32674962,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjc0OTYy",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32674962?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/Rtoax",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Rtoax/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 27,
      "created_at": "2025-10-14T11:38:17Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-10-23T18:56:39Z",
      "closed_at": "2025-10-23T18:56:39Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4727",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4727",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4727.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4727.patch",
        "merged_at": "2025-10-23T18:56:39Z"
      },
      "body": "First, introduce vma.bpf.c to obtain the address of the file mapped in the target process address space. This address can be used to correct the symbol addresses of dynamic libraries and PIE.\r\n    \r\nThen, traverse the address space of the target process and find the minimum address where the ELF file is loaded by matching the ino number, so as to calculate the symbol offset in uaddr() and obtain the accurate symbol address.\r\n\r\nFor example, C code:\r\n\r\n        /* hello.c */\r\n        #include <stdio.h>\r\n    \r\n        static char *ps1_prompt = \"[rongtao@rtoax]$ \";\r\n        int readline(const char *ps1, const char *line) {\r\n          return 0;\r\n        }\r\n    \r\n        int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {\r\n          readline(ps1_prompt, \"echo Hello.\\n\");\r\n          return 0;\r\n        }\r\n\r\nbpftrace script:\r\n    \r\n        # uaddr.bt\r\n        uprobe:/home/rongtao/hello:readline,\r\n        uprobe:/home/rongtao/hello-pie:readline\r\n        {\r\n          $addr = uaddr(\"ps1_prompt\");\r\n          printf(\"%-16s %-8d, ps1_prompt: %p %s\\n\", comm, pid, $addr, str(*$addr));\r\n        }\r\n\r\ntest procedures 1->2->3->4->5->6->7:\r\n\r\n    (1) EXE: $ gcc hello.c -no-pie -o hello\r\n    (4)      $ ./hello\r\n    (2) PIE: $ gcc hello.c -fpie -pie -o hello-pie\r\n    (6)      $ ./hello-pie\r\n    \r\n    (3) $ sudo bpftrace uaddr.bt\r\n        Attached 2 probes\r\n    (5) hello            507158  , ps1_prompt: 0x403008 [rongtao@rtoax]$\r\n    (7) hello-pie        507160  , ps1_prompt: 0x56429d609010 [rongtao@rtoax]$\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4727/reactions",
