      "node_id": "PR_kwDOCMCh9c6ktHYt",
      "number": 4484,
      "title": "Consolidate linking of libbpf and bcc",
      "user": {
        "login": "viktormalik",
        "id": 7603704,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjc2MDM3MDQ=",
        "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7603704?v=4",
        "gravatar_id": "",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/viktormalik",
        "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/followers",
        "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/following{/other_user}",
        "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/gists{/gist_id}",
        "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
        "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/subscriptions",
        "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/orgs",
        "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/repos",
        "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/events{/privacy}",
        "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/viktormalik/received_events",
        "type": "User",
        "user_view_type": "public",
        "site_admin": false
      },
      "labels": [

      ],
      "state": "closed",
      "locked": false,
      "assignees": [

      ],
      "milestone": null,
      "comments": 12,
      "created_at": "2025-08-21T14:54:46Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-09-17T08:39:10Z",
      "closed_at": "2025-09-17T08:39:09Z",
      "assignee": null,
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "issue_field_values": [

      ],
      "type": null,
      "active_lock_reason": null,
      "draft": false,
      "pull_request": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/pulls/4484",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4484",
        "diff_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4484.diff",
        "patch_url": "https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/pull/4484.patch",
        "merged_at": null
      },
      "body": "In CMake, we link `LIBBPF_LIBRARIES` and `LIBBCC_LIBRARIES` from several places, many of which are redundant. In addition, in one place, we link against `libbpf.a`, which CMake turns into `-Wl,-Bstatic -lbpf`, which causes system libbpf be used even if different `libbpf.a` was found in `FindBpf.cmake` (see #4454 for details).\r\n    \r\nConsolidate `CMakeLists.txt` files such that every target which needs `LIBBPF_LIBRARIES` and `LIBBCC_LIBRARIES` links them exactly once. Also drop linking libbpf from the `ast` target (which doesn't need it) and instead add it to the `util` target (since `util/bpf_progs.cpp` uses it).\r\n    \r\nTo prevent the bug fixed by #4429 from repeating, add an explicit `-Wl,-Bstatic` before each linking of `libbpf.a`.\r\n\r\nFinally, add a new section to `INSTALL.md` on how to build and install libbpf from source and how to point CMake to it when it is installed in a non-standard directory. This is useful especially since we now require the latest static libbpf library which many distros do not ship (they either shop too old libbpf or they don't ship static libraries).\r\n\r\nThis should resolve #4454.\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [ ] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [ ] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [ ] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
      "reactions": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bpftrace/bpftrace/issues/4484/reactions",
