      },
      "body": "Stacked PRs:\n * __->__#4516\n\n\n--- --- ---\n\n### ast: add basic comparison and ordering operators\n\n\nThese allow value-based comparison of AST trees, without consideration\nfor the context they are in. It does take into account types, and\ndelegates the comparison in that case to the `SizedType` class.\n\nThis will be used in the future for de-dupping probes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Adin Scannell <amscanne@meta.com>\n",
