      "body": "<!-- \nThe title of the issue should be \"Release v0.<minor>.0\".\n\nFill in the placeholders in the checklist below:\n\n- <minor> is the release minor number \n- <llvm> is the LLVM major number\n- <branching-date> is the date of creating the release branch\n- <release-date> is date of bpftrace release\n\nFor details on the release process, see docs/release_process.md.\nFor LLVM release schedule, see https://llvm.org/.\n-->\n\n### Release progress\n\nNote that LLVM has slightly moved their traditional release schedule so we will release 3 weeks after the LLVM 21 release (not 2 as is usual).\n\n- [x] Mark the release in [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md) and create an \"Unreleased\" section\n- [x] Set `bpftrace_VERSION_MINOR` to `24` in [CMakeLists.txt](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CMakeLists.txt)\n- [x] Add `v0.24-rc0` tag to master\n- [x] Create release branch `release/v0.24.0.x` (August 20, 2025)\n- [x] Add support for LLVM 21\n  - [x] Bump `MAX_LLVM_MAJOR` in [CMakeLists.txt](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CMakeLists.txt)\n  - [x] Add new Nix target in [flake.nix](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/flake.nix)\n  - [x] Add CI job to [.github/workflows/ci.yml](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/.github/workflows/ci.yml)\n- [x] Drop support for LLVM 16\n- [x] Update LLVM in Nixpkgs to 21.1.0\n- [x] **Release bpftrace 0.24.0 (September 17, 2025)**\n  - [x] Add the current date to [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md)\n  - [x] Update `bpftrace_VERSION_*` in [CMakeLists.txt](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CMakeLists.txt)\n  - [x] Draft a new release in GitHub\n  - [x] Update the docs on the bpftrace website. [Instructions](https://github.com/bpftrace/website?#updating-the-docs).\n- [x] Forward-port [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md) and changes to the master branch.\n\nSee [Release Process](https://github.com/bpftrace/bpftrace/blob/master/docs/release_process.md) for general information on the\nrelease process.\n",
