      "issue_dependencies_summary": {
        "blocked_by": 0,
        "total_blocked_by": 0,
        "blocking": 0,
        "total_blocking": 0
      },
      "body": "I use the follow command to build 'bpftrace'\r\n```\r\n# export CC=clang-7\r\n# export CXX=clang++-7\r\n# mkdir -p build && cd build\r\n# cmake -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DSTATIC_LINKING:BOOL=ON ..\r\n# make -j4\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter build success, I use 'ldd' to check the binnary and it hasn't been linked as static:\r\n```\r\nroot@localhost:/data/local/bpftrace/build# ldd ./src/bpftrace\r\n        linux-vdso.so.1 (0x0000007db523f000)\r\n        libclang-7.so.1 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libclang-7.so.1 (0x0000007db3d1b000)\r\n        libLLVM-7.so.1 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libLLVM-7.so.1 (0x0000007db096e000)\r\n        libdl.so.2 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libdl.so.2 (0x0000007db095a000)\r\n        libpthread.so.0 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libpthread.so.0 (0x0000007db092b000)\r\n        libstdc++.so.6 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libstdc++.so.6 (0x0000007db07a0000)\r\n        libm.so.6 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libm.so.6 (0x0000007db06e3000)\r\n        libgcc_s.so.1 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libgcc_s.so.1 (0x0000007db06bd000)\r\n        libc.so.6 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libc.so.6 (0x0000007db054b000)\r\n        libffi.so.6 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libffi.so.6 (0x0000007db0533000)\r\n        libedit.so.2 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libedit.so.2 (0x0000007db04ed000)\r\n        libz.so.1 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libz.so.1 (0x0000007db04c0000)\r\n        librt.so.1 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/librt.so.1 (0x0000007db04a8000)\r\n        libtinfo.so.6 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libtinfo.so.6 (0x0000007db0468000)\r\n        /lib/ld-linux-aarch64.so.1 (0x0000007db5211000)\r\n        libbsd.so.0 => /lib/aarch64-linux-gnu/libbsd.so.0 (0x0000007db0442000)\r\n```\r\n",
