      "body": "Usage:\r\n\r\n```\r\n        $ sudo ./syscount.bt -v -- --sysname\r\n        ....\r\n        @syscallname[newfstatat]: 1510\r\n        @syscallname[ioctl]: 1753\r\n        @syscallname[recvmsg]: 1793\r\n        @syscallname[openat]: 2111\r\n        @syscallname[close]: 2394\r\n        @syscallname[futex]: 2809\r\n        @syscallname[ppoll]: 3346\r\n        @syscallname[read]: 3365\r\n        @syscallname[write]: 3445\r\n```",
