      },
      "body": "can not build static bpftrace in alpine\n\n\n### What reproduces the bug? Provide code if possible.\n\n1. create docker image \n``` shell\ndocker build -t bpftrace-static -f dockerfiles/Dockerfile.static .\n```\n\n2. create container then build, error occurrs\n\n``` shell\ndcebfadeca05:/workspace/OpenSource/bpftrace# cmake -DSTATIC_LINKING=ON -B build\n-- Using static libbfd, need to link additional libraries.\n-- Please install the libblazesym development package (missing: LIBBLAZESYM_LIBRARIES LIBBLAZESYM_INCLUDE_DIRS) \n-- Could NOT find LibXml2 (missing: LIBXML2_LIBRARY LIBXML2_INCLUDE_DIR) \n-- Could NOT find CURL (missing: CURL_LIBRARY CURL_INCLUDE_DIR) \n-- Found LLVM 18.1.8: /usr/lib/llvm18/lib/cmake/llvm\n-- Could NOT find LibXml2 (missing: LIBXML2_LIBRARY LIBXML2_INCLUDE_DIR) \n-- Could NOT find CURL (missing: CURL_LIBRARY CURL_INCLUDE_DIR) \n-- Using SYSTEM_INCLUDE_PATHS=auto\n-- Please install the libebl static library (missing: LIBEBL_LIBRARIES) \nCMake Error at /usr/share/cmake/Modules/FindPackageHandleStandardArgs.cmake:233 (message):\n  Could NOT find GTest (missing: GTEST_LIBRARY GTEST_INCLUDE_DIR\n  GTEST_MAIN_LIBRARY)\nCall Stack (most recent call first):\n  /usr/share/cmake/Modules/FindPackageHandleStandardArgs.cmake:603 (_FPHSA_FAILURE_MESSAGE)\n  /usr/share/cmake/Modules/FindGTest.cmake:273 (FIND_PACKAGE_HANDLE_STANDARD_ARGS)\n  tests/CMakeLists.txt:89 (find_package)\n```\n\n\n### `bpftrace --info` output\n",
