      "body": "Use the inner value_type from TSeriesArgs to determine signedness of output and correctly determine when to draw a zero line.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\n```\r\n@b:\r\n             0                                18446744073709551615\r\nhh:mm:ss.ms  |___________________________________________________|\r\n14:36:54.700 |                                                   * 18446744073709551611\r\n14:36:54.800 |                                                   * 18446744073709551612\r\n14:36:54.900 |                                                   * 18446744073709551613\r\n14:36:55.000 |                                                   * 18446744073709551614\r\n14:36:55.100 |                                                   * 18446744073709551615\r\n14:36:55.200 *                                                   | 0\r\n14:36:55.300 *                                                   | 1\r\n14:36:55.400 *                                                   | 2\r\n14:36:55.500 *                                                   | 3\r\n14:36:55.600 *                                                   | 4\r\n             v___________________________________________________v\r\n             0                                18446744073709551615\r\n```\r\n\r\n### After\r\n```\r\n@b:\r\n             -5                                                  5\r\nhh:mm:ss.ms  |___________________________________________________|\r\n14:30:36.000 |         *               .                         | -3\r\n14:30:36.100 |              *          .                         | -2\r\n14:30:36.200 |                   *     .                         | -1\r\n14:30:36.300 |                         *                         | 0\r\n14:30:36.400 |                         .    *                    | 1\r\n14:30:36.500 |                         .         *               | 2\r\n14:30:36.600 |                         .              *          | 3\r\n14:30:36.700 |                         .                   *     | 4\r\n14:30:36.800 |                         .                         * 5\r\n14:30:36.900 |                         .                   *     | 4\r\n14:30:37.000 |                         .              *          | 3\r\n14:30:37.100 |                         .         *               | 2\r\n14:30:37.200 |                         .    *                    | 1\r\n14:30:37.300 |                         *                         | 0\r\n14:30:37.400 |                   *     .                         | -1\r\n14:30:37.500 |              *          .                         | -2\r\n14:30:37.600 |         *               .                         | -3\r\n14:30:37.700 |    *                    .                         | -4\r\n14:30:37.800 *                         .                         | -5\r\n14:30:37.900 |    *                    .                         | -4\r\n             v___________________________________________________v\r\n             -5                                                  5\r\n```\r\n\r\nFixes: ba5569dd3e8f (\"output: change to using generic output drivers\")\r\nFixes: #4468\r\n\r\n##### Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Language changes are updated in `docs/language.md`, `docs/stdlib.md`, or `man/adoc/bpftrace.adoc`\r\n- [x] User-visible and non-trivial changes updated in `CHANGELOG.md`\r\n- [x] The new behaviour is covered by tests\r\n",
